      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahit gadiyoojiga sean ghayi sin Sulemani aba badayda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Hean gweadu gah Sulemani haleanjeeda ghayi ea ghaydit Dawdeeda was ghwaan; hean goodiiw lapiya, ea lagheanga siguura dahaabu, ea dabita sean mida jeeda gheaseeda gheeda ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sandakwajeanda neajeeda siyeadu jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooweamsiinyi geat Sulemani gweargwa Israeli ea fuga hees bea dooshinga, ea fuga hees bea ghweaniga gealga fuga Israeli, aba Yerusalemu, was fuga jea gweadu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA, gwarina mujiineeda Dawdi, was Sayuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguyeesa headiga sean bea Israeli madeeda sugoocheanda damanda ghweelmeeda, was sheedeaba ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka gweargwa Israeli, aba ng'ata ghwasar sandakwajeanda neajeeda fuga Lawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, ea dabita sean ghaydidi mida jeeda maheemajeanda; hean haleanjeeni seaniin gweadu ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheanda was Sulemani sea guuyeeda sean bea fuga Israeli, guuyeesa madeadaanyi, gwanda madeeda sandakwajeanda, nea gwasin lukghumajeega gisilga saang'a ea heewga manda iitooda nyaawa ghana mooneeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweadu ashoohoodiga sandakwajeanda neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak geayiin heeda was hoorgeadaanyi, mida geeda duukusa jih bea gheeda, was heeda ghaydit muuchi, mida usheaka meang'eega diyeanga dabiniga siguura geeruubajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba diyeanga dabiniga siguura geeruubajeega inyeesa ghwadarda meang'eega nyaawa gwaduk sandakwajeanda, hean inyeesa diyeanga dabiniga siguura geeruubajeega gookwa badayda sandakwajeanda ea daranajeagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea daranajeega ea geawi, aba gideaba iheenga nyaawa inyeesa ghwadaajiit aba heeda ghaydit muuchi madeeda gheeda duukusa jih; nea ea miidaachi aba jarooda; ak hean gwanda hoowa ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jeeda sandakwajeanda neajeeda ea manda gil nuut geaghus beehaji iyeenya ghayi iin jeeda Musa aba Horebu, heeda sissa NG'UTAMIIDA neajeeda sea fuga Israeli, damanda rinna ng'eanyiida Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwarina ashoohoodiga heeda ghaydit (aba gideaba ashoohoodiga mida hoowa niimmiidu geat nea maduupa galanyoojiga nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea fuga Lawi was hirgheata sarmani, sea Asafu, ea Hemani, ea Yedudani, ea diibiga nyaawa, ea fuga duupchi, nea gookwa hang'weaka miyaasiin bumbuni, nea gwandeawa gureayeeka, ea ginandajeega, ea gidoondoorajeega, ak ghamiinaada aba gayeewda heeda wagiida sea ashoohoodiga was mooneeda nyaawa bughala ea diktam nea ghaghuut durumbeati; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoah damanda fuga ghuuda durumbeati ea fuga sarmani ghwanung' eayiiy ghuusiga nyaawa nea gaba iidagi, aba gidaduumsiinda ea badiischooda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA). Hean nea geesarmani, aba durumbeati ea gureayeeka, ea haleanjoojiga suurja sisarmaniida, inyeesa gwaduumsheesa NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
